# Xbox 360 Xenon VMX128: the 128-register vector extension of the Xenon PowerPC cores (vr0..vr127,
# vr0..vr31 being the AltiVec registers), its loads/stores and operations in primary opcodes 4, 5
# and 6. Written from the Xenia emulator's instruction table and decode formats (BSD-3).

